                                                "sense_id": "53fec614-ccd7-3ec6-94d2-5682260ebd70",
                                                "text": "the waverings of politicians, trying to please everybody"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7d81d7c7-baaf-4fc0-b4f6-74ba23f1dbdf",
                                                "sense_id": "53fec614-ccd7-3ec6-94d2-5682260ebd70",
                                                "text": "The Bill for the Carlisle & Hawick Railway, an independent line, but intended to be worked and maintained by the Caledonian, failed, and the people of Hawick, after considerable wavering, decided to give their support to the North British Border Union line, which the Carlisle & Hawick scheme was, of course, intended to block."
                                            }
